i di protezione individuale possono trasformarsi rapidamente in situazioni pericolose. Imparate a riconoscere tempestivamente i pericoli e ad agire in modo sicuro.", "short_description": "Scoprite la sicurezza sul lavoro nell'edilizia in legno in modo virtuale e realistico: riconoscere i rischi tipici, reagire correttamente, senza alcun pericolo di lesioni. Imparate a evitare errori e a utilizzare in modo sicuro utensili e moduli."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Querformat.png", "id": "1735425970481901", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821696_1735425973815234_7026648888461368653_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tlJ75V8j46EQ7kNvwEk1-Vb&_nc_oc=AdrLYrEaC3mSEwLRJTX88_ORFbP99uiBgX9F2a0ldZL2JVLbP1Zz2LmBAmcRnRu8vrE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQHBP5ZbCThUXpdqCThxuk0aBHqQwuJuBI0iNpjRUVFvQ&oe=6AE88BA3"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1404469407857988", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819845_1404469411191321_2374008257608234867_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=U3_cZjAzQV4Q7kNvwG7bG2s&_nc_oc=AdqiSTmLuaUcNTPbwpEq0ptrfZWJFXJqx0HGWu3Rp1oOe-NFwZU4Uf0Zu_lIWl5_YKQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTvxPxELUB4BQ61CbgYniqG0H9tZFsGhYl1nUq9uuzEqA&oe=6AE8AFDD"}, {"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Hochformat.png", "id": "1138371601691473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_1138371605024806_6545105809583793091_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KN1nnFxb2WwQ7kNvwGdFkQJ&_nc_oc=AdrZE6y-7afnbR9tNxTWsLo5XXsopKgwMhwWf-PBJ6FXqjA8XU2W6o1dnya3UGHDuSg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQStLjb5q7tzlZVj5czV_0t-TDoe62Nb1hLhEMRCComspw&oe=6AE89E4A"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1061729109131103", "im